new('physicien','physicien','noun masculine singular historical','natural philosopher; scholar studying nature',['physician treating patients','sailor','priest'],'Le savant qui étudie les phénomènes de la nature est un ___.',['physicien','médecin','matelot','aumônier'],'Quel nom masculin désigne ici un savant qui étudie la nature ?',note='The reasoner uses instruments and geometry to study the giants; historical physicien is a student of natural phenomena, not an English physician. Physicien/médecin/matelot/aumônier are masculine singular and fit un. The scientific-natural role selects physicien without asserting a modern disciplinary specialization.')
